  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;an arbitrary&nbsp;constant)"
  },
